    {
      "name": "检查矩差，显式代入三参数",
      "description": "矩差满足可采纳条件后，把三个样本矩代入Cran式(2a–c)，一次得到形状、位置、尺度。",
      "formula": {
        "expression": "\\begin{gathered}m_1-m_2>m_2-m_4>0\\\\[6pt]\\begin{gathered}\\beta^*=\\frac{\\ln2}{\\ln(m_1-m_2)-\\ln(m_2-m_4)}\\\\[5pt] \\gamma^*=\\frac{m_1m_4-m_2^2}{m_1+m_4-2m_2}\\\\[5pt] \\eta^*=\\frac{m_1-\\gamma^*}{\\Gamma(1+1/\\beta^*)}\\end{gathered}\\end{gathered}",
        "explanation": "矩差满足可采纳条件后，把三个样本矩代入Cran式(2a–c)，一次得到形状、位置、尺度。",
